<title>CHINA: Trade in United Pacific shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in United Pacific shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in United Pacific Industries Ltd shares was suspended Thursday morning pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The share closed at HK$1.40 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
